        // - To survive, we need to last long enough. The number of turns is determined by the monster's HP.
        //   Max monster HP is 100. So we need to survive at most 100 turns (if we do 1 damage per turn).
        //   Damage taken per turn is max(0, atkM - (defY + addDef)). Max atkM is 100.
        //   If we buy enough DEF to make damage 0, we survive indefinitely.
        //   If we don't, we need HP to cover the total damage.
