        //   So buying up to 10000 HP might be needed? But wait, if we buy DEF, we reduce damage.
        //   Let's bound the search space more tightly.
        //   Max turns needed to kill monster: if we do 1 damage per turn, it takes hpM turns. hpM <= 100.
        //   So we need to survive at most 100 turns.
